WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A new documentary
about Pope Francis

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
was released last week
and in it,

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Pope says,
for the first time ever,

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.539 line:92%
that he thinks same-sex couple

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:08.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
should be able to have
civil unions.

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:10.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
One of our writers,
Jenny Hagel, is gay

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she's here to comment.
Hi, Jenny!

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:13.747 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hi, Seth.

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:15.048 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I'm here at the Vatican

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.916 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and everyone is buzzing.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:19.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Pope has said
that same-sex couples

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:21.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
should be allowed
to have civil unions.

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.223 line:92%
This is really exciting stuff!

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it? I mean, I haven't
heard people advocate

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
for civil unions
since the late '90s.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:29.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, it feels a little,
I don't know, outdated.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seth, the Catholic Church
is an old institution.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.467 line:92%
Sometimes, change comes slowly

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
but when it comes,
it is thrilling.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:38.505 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh.

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:39.506 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wow, Seth!

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:41.508 line:92%
There's some more breaking news.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.443 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
This is huge!

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:44.811 line:92%
The Pope has just said he thinks

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:47.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
we should all get
dial-up Internet.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:48.648 line:92%
-Oh, wow, Jenny, are you sur

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're not getting
an old news update?

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.786 line:92%
-No, Seth, this happened today

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.387 line:92%
The Pope has given his blessing.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:56.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said we can all get
dial-up Internet,

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I think that is
huge progress.

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:00.093 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-I don't think it is.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:03.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
Again, it sounds
kind of outdated.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.097 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh! Oh.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.599 size:84% position:42%
Seth, the Pope has just
released a statement.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.701 line:92%
It says, "Have you guys hear

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
'The Miseducation
of Lauryn Hill'?

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:12.772 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's a great album.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:14.574 line:92%
You should check it out."

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:18.078 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wow, Seth, wow!

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.746 size:84% position:42% line:92%
This Pope is very cool!

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:22.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is he?
-Oh, oh, wait, there's more.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:25.452
He also said he's got some
great Monica Lewinsky jokes.

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's going to read them
from the balcony

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.221 size:78% position:39% line:92%
in St. Peter's Square

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:31.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he feels confident
they will age really well.

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, they're not going
to age well.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:34.727 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Seth, this is major!

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:37.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Jenny, I don't think thes
little bits of news

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:38.932 line:92%
warrant all this excitement.

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.967 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Of course they do.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:42.669 line:92%
Francis became Pope in 201

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:45.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it took him
just seven short years

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:46.172 line:92%
to get onboard with a policy

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
that everyone else
abandoned 20 years ago.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of straight people calle
to tell me this news

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:52.512 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and I was very excited.

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:56.483
As excited as if they had told
me they just got a car phone

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:57.450 line:92%
-Oh, I see what you're doing

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.653
You're saying there's a reason
people abandoned civil unions --

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:02.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they're not equal
to marriage.

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:04.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
Telling same-sex couples
they should have civil union

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:07.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
sounds a lot like saying
they're second-class citizens.

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.497 line:92%
-That's exactly what I'm saying.

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:11.631 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, my God.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:12.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Don't tell me.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:13.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seth, you're not going
to believe this.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:14.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I really don't want
to know.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:18.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seth, the Pope
just got a new haircut

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:21.007 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and it. is. fresh!

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:21.941 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What?!

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is that the Pope
with the Rachel?

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:26.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes!
He's on the cutting edge!

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:27.280 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my goodness!

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is amazing!
Jenny Hagel, everyone.

